# Line endings — make normalisation explicit rather than dependent on each contributor's
# core.autocrlf. Text files are stored LF in the repository and checked out CRLF in the working
# tree, which is what .editorconfig (end_of_line = crlf) and `dotnet format` expect. Without this,
# a contributor with core.autocrlf=false commits CRLF blobs, and one with =input gets an LF working
# tree that fails `dotnet format --verify-no-changes`.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Binary assets — never line-ending-converted or diffed as text. `text=auto` already detects these,
# but naming them keeps a stray null-free file (e.g. an SVG-ish blob) from being misclassified.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.thumbnail binary
